  "text": "\r\n\t\t Elections and Voter Information | Hollis, NH \r\n Skip to Main Content \r\nCreate a Website Account   - Manage notification subscriptions, save form progress and more.    \r\nWebsite Sign In \r\n     Departments   \t\t\t \n     Boards & Committees   \t\t\t \n     Online Services   \t\t\t \n     Community   \t\t\t \n     How Do I?   \t\t\t \r\n\t\t\t Search \n\t\t\t Absentee Ballot Information \r\n\t\t\t How to Vote \r\n\t\t\t Elections \r\n\t\t\t Registering to Vote \r\nHome \nDepartments \nTown Clerk \nElections and Voter Information \r\nElections and Voter Information\t\t \r\nRegistration information, sample ballots, absentee ballot information. Note: You may register to vote on Election Day at the polls. \nRegistering to Vote  - Where to go, what to bring, Hollis does not have any ward numbers \nCome to the Town Clerk's office to fill out the Voter Registration Form. Bring your driver's license,  And  passport or birth certificate. \nFrequently Asked Questions about Establishing a Domicile / Residence in New Hampshire (PDF) \nHow to Vote  - Voter ID Law  \nAbsentee Ballot Information  - How to obtain Absentee Ballot or check status \nElections  - Dates, Location, Sample Ballots, Results. If you wish to volunteer at the polls, please contact the Supervisor of the Checklist, Chairman, Mary Thomas directly. \nParty Affiliation -  Check your party affiliation online  - You will need to fill out a new Voter Registration form with the Town Clerk to change your party affiliation. \nSupervisors of the Checklist \nMary Thomas , Chairman \nThom Davies \nRobbin Dunn \nTown Moderator \nDrew Mason \nNH Secretary of State website \r\nContact Us \r\n\t\t\t\t\tDiane Leavitt\r\nTown Clerk \r\nMore Information \r\nTown Clerk \r\n\t\t\t\t\t Physical Address \r\n\t\t\t\t\t Town Clerk, 3G Market Place \n\t\t\t\t\t Hollis ,  NH   03049 \r\nPhone:  603-465-2064 \r\nHours \nMonday \nnoon to 5 pm \nWednesday \n8 am to 2 pm \nFriday \n8 am to 2 pm \r\nDirectory \r\n\t\t\t Minutes & Agenda \r\n\t\t\t Notify Me \r\n\t\t\t Vehicle Registration \r\n\t\t\t Job Opportunities \r\n\t\t\t Notices & Bids \r\n\t\t\t Hours & Contacts \r\nHollis, NH \r\nHollis Town Hall \r\n7 Monument Square \r\nHollis, NH 03049 \r\n         Home \n         Site Map \n         Accessibility \n         Copyright Notices \n         Privacy Policy \n/QuickLinks.aspx \r\n   Government Websites by  CivicPlus® \nLoading \r\n\t\t\t\tLoading\r\n\t\t\t Do Not Show Again \r\n\t\t\t Close \r\n\t\t\t Arrow Left \r\n\t\t\t Arrow Right \r\n[] \r\n                     Slideshow Left Arrow \r\n                     Slideshow Right Arrow \r\n ",
